SUBSEQUENT ACCESS:

1. Open browser again.
2. Visit http://ledgerai.local.
3. LedgerAI PH identifies the previously selected company preference.
4. Immediately display the ABC Trading Corporation login page.
5. User enters credentials.
6. Server authenticates the user.
7. Server validates company authorization.
